                             nothing delivers an IRQ inside a spin loop. the private design notes.
dwc-nonport-prefix           bet 1.6a. NitroDWC gs/nonport.h: __asm__("gsi_nitro_<name>") on socket, closesocket, shutdown, bind, connect, listen, accept, recv, recvfrom, send,
                             sendto, getsockopt, setsockopt, getsockname, inet_addr, time, so libctru's / newlib's symbols are not hit. the private design notes.
gds-single-definition        bet 1.6a. lib/gds/include/gds_internal.h + src/ov61_0222CEDC.c: Unk_ov61_0222E764 is defined once (extern in the header; mwcc merged the header's
                             tentative definitions, GCC does not).
nitrosdk-g3-ports            bet 2.1a. The geometry-engine input hooks of the SDK: ioreg_G3.h (HWG3_STORE / HWG3_STORE_OFS / HWG3_FIFO around every reg_G3_* store), mi/memory.h
                             (MIi_IS_G3_PORT: MI_CpuCopy32 / MI_CpuSend32 / MI_CpuCopyFast aimed at 0x400..0x5FF), gx/g3imm.h, gx/src/g3imm.c, gx/src/g3_util.c.
                             the private design notes.
nitrosystem-g3-ports         bet 2.1a. The same hooks in NitroSystem: g3d/src/sbc.c, g3d/src/util.c, g3d/src/gecom.c, g2d/src/g2d_OamSoftwareSpriteDraw.c.
main-boot-trace              bets 1.6a, 2.1d, 2.1e. Trace-only lines (Rule 2: no behaviour change): src/main.c (boot milestones), src/field_system.c (FieldSystem continue),
                             src/field_map_change.c (`boot: field landed`), src/billboard_vram_transfer.c (2.1e: `boot: billboard null tex idx=.. pltt idx=.. seq=..` when a
