port-vblank-task-queue       bet 2.2a2. system.c: VBLANK_TASK_MAX 32 -> 128 (the cooperative vblank cannot drain the list during a one-frame field load; the private design notes slice (a2)).
port-wide-camera             bet 2.8. src/camera.c, Camera_ComputeProjectionMatrix only: the two projection calls take sinFovY through HWDEV_WideSin and the aspect through
                             HWDEV_WideAspect, and one line after each hands the matrix the game built (and camera->distance) to HWDEV_WideProjection. All three are the
                             identity / a no-op unless config.ini wide = 1 (source/hw/hw_devs.c). camera->perspective is never written. the private design notes.

